description": "Are we living in a society that is making us mentally unwell, then prescribing drugs to treat the consequences?Show more This week on VSRF Live, Livio Sanchez returns as host, joined by patient and drug safety advocate Kim Witczak for a wide-ranging conversation about the state of our mental health and the growing influence of the pharmaceutical industry.\nFrom the psychological effects of social media and smartphone addiction to the relentless cycle of fear, uncertainty, and crisis-driven headlines, modern life is taking a toll. Add financial pressures, loneliness, and the emotional challenges of the approaching holidays, and it's little wonder so many Americans are struggling.\nBut when did the ordinary human experiences of sadness, grief, anxiety, and stress become conditions requiring medical treatment? Are we too quick to prescribe medications rather than address the underlying causes of emotional distress?\nFor Kim, these questions are deeply personal. In 2003, her husband, Woody, died by suicide at age 37, just five weeks after being prescribed Zoloft off-label for insomnia. His death launched Kim on a decades-long mission to expose drug safety risks, strengthen warning labels, and demand greater accountability from pharmaceutical companies and federal regulators.\nKim will also discuss her latest efforts to bring attention to persistent adverse effects associated with antidepressants, including the need for greater research, recognition, and transparency.\nJoin Livio and Kim as they examine the intersection of mental health, modern culture, and pharmaceutical influence, and ask whether our approach to mental health is helping people heal or creating new problems.\nBecause not every emotion is a disorder, and not every difficult moment needs a prescription. Show less", "thumbnail": "https://hugh.cdn.rumble.cloud/video/fwe2/d9/s8/1/8/P/Z/_/8PZ_A.qR4e.2-small-VSRF-Live-252-Mental-Health..jpg", "display_id": "v7fhldy", "fulltitle": "VSRF Live #252 - Mental Health Under Siege", "duration_string": "1:16:08", "upload_date": "20261031", "release_date": "20261104", "release_year": 2026, "is_live": false, "was_live": true, "epoch": 1794327256, "acodec": "aac", "vcodec": "none", "url": "https://hugh.cdn.rumble.cloud/video/fwe2/d9/s8/2/8/P/Z/_/8PZ_A.Gaa.rec.aac", "format_id": "audio-192p", "tbr": 191, "filesize": 109654100, "width": 0, "height": 192, "protocol": "https", "ext": "aac", "audio_ext": "aac", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 191, "resolution": "audio only", "aspect_ratio": 0.0, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate"}, "format": "audio-192p - audio only", "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.11.04.232659", "release_git_head": "412e7f0a4b0588fe884a02b344ac66a06538475b", "repository": "yt-dlp/yt-dlp-nightly-builds"}}